  "title": "Zesty Vegetarian Sweet and Sour Meatballs",
  "description": "Vegetarian 'meat' balls use ground pecans and cornflake crumbs in place of meat. They have a savory taste that complements the yummy apricot sweet and sour sauce that goes with them.",
  "authors": [
    "thechulita"
